OL,5,G0300 Grantchester
OL,6,     FWhen the circus comes to town,
OL,7,     FWill and Geordie investigate after
OL,8,     Fone of the performers is found
OL,9,     Fdead having been shot with a
OL,10,     Fcrossbow that was used in a magic
OL,11,     Ftrick. After finding out the
OL,12,     Fcrossbow was tampered with and the
OL,13,     Fdeath wasn't an accident, the pair
OL,14,     Fhave a difficult task in solving
OL,15,     Fthe crime as all the performers
OL,16,     Fhave alibis for the time of the
OL,17,     Fmurder and the circus was closed
